// The SPA's requests that reached 3 s, reported through the client telemetry relay.
// Backs the "the web client is slow" alert: the browser's view of a request includes the network
// and the queueing the server's own durations miss. One that ended, failed, was cancelled by a user
// who gave up, or was still pending when the tab was hidden counts alike: each kept someone waiting.
customMetrics
| where name == "tellma.client.requests.slow"
| summarize slow = sum(valueSum) by bin(timestamp, 15m)
| where slow > 50
